Package: memdash
Type: Package
Title: Shiny Dashboard for Memgraph via the Python neo4j Driver (reticulate)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("memdash contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A NeoDash-style Shiny dashboard for Memgraph. Connects over Bolt
    using the official Python 'neo4j' driver through reticulate, runs plain
    openCypher, and renders results as tables, graphs, charts, metrics,
    Markdown or JSON cards.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
